characteristic function $\varphi(t) = \int e^{itx}\, d\mu(x)$. Prove that
$\varphi$ is uniformly continuous on $\mathbb{R}$, and that if
$\int |x| \, d\mu(x) < \infty$ then $\varphi$ is differentiable with
